    "detailed_description": "<strong>Plates of Peril</strong> is a dark <strong>dungeon-cooking</strong> game where you gather ingredients, prepare dishes, and serve them to demanding customers. <u><i>Play solo or team up with up to 3 friends</i></u> as you survive the chaos to <strong>become the ultimate chef in a dungeon full of danger.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/531c880fc95a7c44d7bc97684470d3a5.webp?t=1739233857\" width=225 height=25 /></span><br><strong>Explore the procedurally generated dungeons to gather ingredients for your dishes.<br>But watch out for traps, and be careful, you'll never know who or what is hiding.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/0fbd961b218be218a1409fa6c744b60b.webp?t=1739233857\" width=225 height=25 /></span><br><strong>Combine your ingredients to make unique dishes and boost your reputation as a chef of the dungeon!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/21fa6dc2486e1793d09614f797eb1ac7.webp?t=1739233857\" width=225 height=25 /></span><br><strong>Occasionally, your boss will drop by for a taste test.<br>Serve perfection, or suffer the consequences.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/c8f12d48a7d070472969c82dff364551.webp?t=1739233857\" width=225 height=25 /></span><br><strong>Team up with up to 3 friends in chaotic co-op gameplay!<br>Work together to gather ingredients, cook dishes, and survive the dungeon\u2019s peril.<br>Who is the best chef?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/bada344bbfbfc1627c94731f00ad5751.webp?t=1739233857\" width=225 height=25 /></span><br><strong>Instead of serving food to customers, eat your favorite foods for strategic stat boosts.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/e405cea86d14fd9ba63e9e0a77506f85.webp?t=1739233857\" width=225 height=25 /></span><br><strong>With changing dungeon layouts and customer needs, no two runs are the same.</strong>",
